1 imagination mitigation\n  claim:\n  - C6\n  description: 'CANCELLED after D038: same reason as plan_024.'\n  priority: CANCELLED\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps:\n  - plan_050\n- id: plan_034\n  name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  claim:\n  - C2\n  description: Compute classification accuracy at nve thresholds 1.3x, 1.5x, 1.7x,\n    2.0x across all available seeds. Report AUROC if feasible. 0 GPU cost — computed\n    from existing metrics.\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n  deps: []\n- id: plan_015\n  name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8 (1 seed)\n  claim:\n  - C2\n  description: 'D041 redesign (原 detach 方案是 no-op): freeze dt_embedding (requires_grad=False),\n    保持随机初始化不训练。其余与 008d 一致 (subsample ON, dt=2, H=8)。诊断问题: dt_emb 的 TRAINING 是否是 CIVO\n    的必要条件？与 plan_017 构成 2×2 消融矩阵。预期不崩溃 → trained dt_emb 是必要条件。'\n  priority: P0\n  gpu_budget_hours: 5","numLines":200,"startLine":100,"totalLines":342}}}
